---
description: Keep whitespace tight (no extra blank lines)
alwaysApply: true
globs: **/*
---

# Whitespace Rules

- Do not add **2 consecutive blank lines** anywhere in a file.
- At end-of-file (EOF), allow **at most 1 trailing blank line** to satisfy git newline rules.
- Prefer **exactly 1** blank line between logical sections; otherwise write lines without extra whitespace.

